{
  "schema": "yoyo.swplan/1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "探针 S族：曲面拉伸(60×40 方管) → 加厚 side1 成实体；手算 25440mm³ / 66×46×40",
    "units": "mm",
    "note": [
      "★ 为什么体积是 25440 而不是 8000×3=24000：",
      "  方管是**闭合环**，加厚出来的横截面是**环**不是片。",
      "  side1(外偏 3mm)：外框 66×46 − 内框 60×40 = 3036−2400 = 636mm²，×高 40 = 25440mm³。",
      "  side2(内偏 3mm)：外框 60×40 − 内框 54×34 = 2400−1836 = 564mm²，×40 = 22560mm³。",
      "  both(各 1.5mm)：25440+22560 = 48000mm³。",
      "  这三个数是 2026-10-09 真机实测值，**逐位吻合**，是本族的回归基准。",
      "★ 加厚必须 mark=1 选曲面体（SURFACEBODY）—— 见 sw_ops.op_thicken 文档。"
    ]
  },
  "params": {},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "n",
      "op": "new_part"
    },
    {
      "id": "p",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "r1",
      "op": "rect_corner",
      "x1": -30,
      "y1": -20,
      "x2": 30,
      "y2": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "SrfSk"
    },
    {
      "id": "se",
      "op": "surface_extrude",
      "depth": 40,
      "name": "Srf1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb1",
      "op": "check_bbox",
      "expect": [60, 40, 40],
      "tol": 0.05
    },
    {
      "id": "tk",
      "op": "thicken",
      "targets": ["Srf1"],
      "thickness": 3,
      "direction": "side1",
      "name": "Solid1"
    },
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "op": "check_mass",
      "expect_volume_mm3": 25440,
      "vol_tol": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "bb2",
      "op": "check_bbox",
      "expect": [66, 46, 40],
      "tol": 0.6
    }
  ]
}
